e and reachability monitoring. Collection is watchlist driven: only targets you name are ever polled.' 'path:Inspect a bounded endpoint path across cached topology and live read-only forwarding evidence.' 'excel:Correlate your own Excel workbooks with Netrunes inventory, and build tracker workbooks.' 'support:Create privacy-redacted diagnostics for support and bug reports.')'
