mory state.' 'moves:Show recorded AP switch/port movement events.' 'timeline:Show AP attachment timeline events.' 'merge:Retire an old AP into the current APs chronological identity. The old record leaves active inventory but remains searchable historical memory.' 'merges:List active manual AP merges newest first; --all includes revoked merges.' 'unmerge:Revoke a manual AP merge and restore its source snapshot when the old IP has not been reassigned.')' ;;
