      device) _describe 'action' '('ssh:Open an interactive SSH session using netrune-connect. If SSH negotiation reports legacy algorithms, retry with -l/--legacy.' 'show:Run a read-only show command through netrune-control.' 'config:Run configuration commands on one or many devices (comma list, --target, --file, or --all) through the guarded backup/apply/verify lifecycle. Naming no device requires --all. Requires --dry-run or --confirm.' 'inventory:View or enrich device inventory through netrune-control.' 'support:Show registered Cisco, Aruba, and Ruckus driver capabilities, or classify one inventory target.' 'identity:Explain name, IP, MAC, serial, model, and attachment evidence used to assess two switch records.' 'trust-status:Inspect the private managed known-hosts store without touching the network.' 'trust-scan:Retrieve current SSH host keys and print SHA-256 fingerprints without trusting them.' 'trust-enroll:Store only host keys whose out-of-band verified fingerprints match the scan.' 'trust-forget:Remove a target from the managed trust store after explicit confirmation.')' ;;
